configuration file
   extension *.cfg
   keys
      preset_<N>
      configuration_<N>

   preset fields
      row
      column

   configuration fields
      row
      label

state file
   extension *.cfg
   keys
      css_path
      configurations
      last_preset
      grid_columns
      grid_rows
      local_camera
      local_port
      remote_camera
      remote_port

      image_<N>

   image fields
      file name

   css_path fields
      file name

   configurations
      number of configurations in setup file

   grid_columns fields
      number of grid columns in screen

   grid_rows fields
      number of grid rows in screen

   local_camera fields
      IP address for camera on same network as application is running

   local_port
      port number for camera on same network as application is running

   remote_camera fields
      address type URL |
      address for camera on different network as application is running
         either IP or URL

   remote_port
      port number for camera on different network as application is running


